Task-Name: amerika-desktop-minimal
Task-Description: Amerika OS desktop, minimal
Task-Long-Description: The Amerika session, shell, settings, theme and defaults with the smallest
 sensible set of applications: no Amerika Social, Venture or Office, and none of the extra
 media, graphics or development tools of amerika-desktop-full. Add applications with Amerika
 Software or install amerika-desktop for the usual set.
